/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 548 0 R
/E (This project is a simple JavaFX-based application designed to manage hotel room bookings and guest records efficiently. It provides an easy-to-use interface for reserving rooms, viewing current bookings, and handling guest check-out.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
