156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 549 0 R
/E (In many small hotels, room booking is often managed manually, which can lead to problems such as double booking, data confusion, and difficulty in tracking guest details. This project is motivated by the need to create a basic digital solution to simplify these operations.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 550 0 R
/E (The system helps solve real-world issues by ensuring that each room is booked only once at a time, maintaining organized reservation data, and allowing easy check-out of guests. It demonstrates how software can improve accuracy, efficiency, and management in hotel operations.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
