178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 567 0 R
/E (In many small hotels, room reservation and guest management are handled manually or with basic systems. This often leads to issues such as double booking of rooms, difficulty in tracking guest details, and lack of proper record management.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 568 0 R
/E (These existing methods are inefficient because they are prone to human errors, time-consuming, and do not provide a clear view of current room availability. Managing check-in and check-out processes can also become confusing without a structured system.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 569 0 R
/E (This project aims to address these challenges by providing a simple JavaFX-based application that automates room reservation, prevents duplicate bookings, and allows easy tracking and check-out of guests, thereby improving efficiency and accuracy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
